1.0.6:
    - main window now cannot be maximized
    - fixed CH3 Special Mode keyOn/keyOff behavior with tracker exported VGM
    files (issues #0000036 and #0000038)
    - YM2612 registers are now reset when needed (issues #0000027, #0000036 and #0000037)
    - RYMCast now runs under OSX starting from version 10.8 and above (issue
    #0000035)

1.0.5:
    - fixed a regression with some VGM files

1.0.4:
    - added executable icon for Windows build
    - added default LFO enable/speed/PMSxMW settings for .repatch files
    - added keyboard shortcuts for mutes and solos (F1 to F10, +SHIFT for solos)
    - added support for VGM streaming commands (0x90...0x95), Deflemask exported VGM files now play correctly (issue #0000022 & #0000023)
    - aborting an audio export now works correctly and immediately (files are also deleted now) (issue #0000025)
    - temporary .repatch or .dmp files are now deleted on exit (issue #0000026)
    - time bar now supports cursor dragging from anywhere (issue #0000020)
    - on macOS, drag'n'drop of a VGM file to the app icon (Finder or Dock) is now supported (issue #0000018)
    - fixed time bar graphical glitch when seeking
    - fixed keyOn/keyOff problem with VGM files exported with VGM Music Maker
    - stop button should reset paused state (issue #0000015)
    - fixed issue where pressing stop on an empty RYMCast causes it to crash (issue #0000019)
    - fixed audio scopes bounds
    - fixed memory leak when exiting after loading a VGM (not VGZ) file
    - various GUI refinements
    - various bugfixes

1.0.3:
    First public beta
